{"unit_id": "tag:0F1I:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个域（field）。对于任意交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0002>\n，其中各项均为<MATH_0003>上的概形（schemes），满足<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>，且<MATH_0006>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），以及任意阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0007>，它位于<MATH_0008>上且其茎（stalks）均为挠的（torsion），阶（orders）在<MATH_0009>中可逆（invertible），基变换（base change）映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>\n是一个同构（isomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠的"}, {"source_term": "orders", "target_term": "阶"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "底域"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "基变换图"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "图中的概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离", "context": "态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "abelian sheaf", "target_term": "阿贝尔层", "context": "层的系数"}, {"source_term": "stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "层的茎"}, {"source_term": "torsion", "target_term": "挠的", "context": "茎的挠性"}, {"source_term": "orders", "target_term": "阶", "context": "挠的阶"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "阶在底域中可逆"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "基变换映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "自然映射"}, {"source_te